{"step_index":624,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T01:07:02Z","thinking":"Initiating a search for connections between author \"우수경\" and \"이석창,\" considering their potential relationship within the \"만화\" (comic) domain, specifically exploring agencies, studios, publishing companies, or comic studios. Shifting focus to a spreadsheet, \"기업 정보\" sheet of an Excel file, to investigate the search terms \"디어 마이 유니버스\" and \"만화\" to find potential leads or context.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Search comic rows in Excel","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import openpyxl\nimport json\n\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('data/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx', read_only=True, data_only=True)\nresults = []\nfor sname in wb.sheetnames:\n    ws = wb[sname]\n    headers = []\n    for i, row in enumerate(ws.iter_rows(values_only=True)):\n        if i == 0:\n            headers = [str(c) if c is not None else \"\" for c in row]\n            continue\n        row_str = [str(c) if c is not None else \"\" for c in row]\n        row_joined = \" \".join(row_str)\n        if \"만화\" in row_joined or \"웹툰\" in row_joined or \"우수경\" in row_joined:\n            results.append({\"sheet\": sname, \"row_idx\": i+1, \"row\": row_str[:15]})\nwb.close()\n\nprint(f\"Total comic/webtoon/woosukyeong rows: {len(results)}\")\nfor r in results[:20]:\n    print(r)\n\nwith open(\"C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228844c1-7cf3-4d15-8f56-9f1d0de8a851/scratch/comic_rows.json\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump(results, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n","Description":"Search comic rows in excel","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228844c1-7cf3-4d15-8f56-9f1d0de8a851\\scratch\\search_comic_rows.py","toolAction":"Write search_comic_rows.py","toolSummary":"Writing comic rows search script"}}]}
